      "agendaKind": "",
      "notes": "Princess of Gorse, twenty-two, human, dry as a biscuit, doing the crossword in a dragon's cave. She has been the guest of Grunwald the Considerate for six weeks and has heard two volumes of his memoirs. She is not in danger and says so in every letter. She would like to be collected before the third volume, ideally by someone who can hold a conversation.",
      "secret": "She has been sending letters home by griffin every week saying she is not in danger, and the King has hidden every one of them in a drawer, because a rescue is Tradition and Tradition has no chapter for a princess who is not in danger.",
      "revealAct": 1
    },
    {
