      "threat": "apex",
      "notes": "Large, red, endlessly polite, and lethal if anyone is rude first, which nobody in Gorse has been. Breath of fire, wings, a memory for slights two centuries long, and a memoir. He does not want a fight; he wants a reader. A player who draws steel is asked, courteously, to put it away, once."
    },
